# Player birthday gift talk (en-US source).
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.c_thanks=Thank you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.body=Happy birthday. This is for you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.elder=Happy birthday. I saved this for you, as a friend should.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.innkeeper=Happy birthday from the inn. Eat well today.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.priestess=A birthday blessing. Keep it close.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.farmer=Happy birthday. From my stores to you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.merchant=Happy birthday. I do not give stock away lightly. Wear it well.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.blacksmith=Forged for your birthday, and now it is yours. Use it well.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.florist=Flowers for your birthday. A little color for the day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.rancher=Happy birthday from the ranch. Keep warm out there.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.miner=Dug up for your birthday. Do not spend it all in one place.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.logger=Seeds for your birthday. Plant them when you can.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.builder=Metal for your birthday. Build something that lasts.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.chef=Fresh from the kitchen for your birthday. Do not let it get cold.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.crystal_keeper=A little light for your birthday. Friendship grows slowly, like crystal.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.pyrotechnic=Mining bombs for your birthday. Throw them at stone and ore. You stay safe.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.bard=Crystals for your birthday. Catch them in the light.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.guild_master=For the town, and for your birthday. A party shares its best kit.
aetherhaven.dialogue.player.birthday.incoming.clown=Do not make a speech. Take the gift and go be happy. It is your birthday.
